  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;be the adjoint of a matrix&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mi>B</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
